 customization research. Unlock different wallpapers, lights, counter fronts, and tops for the inside of your bakery. Show your storefront some love too with different windows, awnings, doors, and building colors!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196120/extras/1dcc3199db16e60661092f9d648d3e5c.avif?t=1679787708\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196120/extras/e26d837f9f0822404415c773db4f0661.poster.avif?t=1679787708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196120/extras/e26d837f9f0822404415c773db4f0661.webm?t=1679787708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196120/extras/e26d837f9f0822404415c773db4f0661.mp4?t=1679787708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Like donuts? Have a bakery focused on donuts. Prefer cupcakes? That\u2019s great! You can freely unlock recipes from the different categories to make your dream bakery and sell whatever you like! (<i>*whisper*</i> Secretly despise carrot cake? That\u2019s fine, don\u2019t sell it! We like it, but you do you.) Or go crazy and unlock it all!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196120/extras/58177ddd3eedfd541fd36ea404d39403.avif?t=1679787708\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196120/extras/f0a6961656e79c197f3544585eb7ef69.poster.avif?t=1679787708\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196120/extras/f0a6961656e79c197f3544585eb7ef69.webm?t=1679787708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\